WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,000
starting from today

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,080
I won't follow you anymore

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,560
Where can we go if you leave?

4
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,560
Zhang Feifei may not accept you.

5
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:09,710
Then I will find a job by myself

6
00:00:09,710 --> 00:00:11,110
I didn't speak before

7
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:13,750
Because I think the most important thing is for everyone to survive together

8
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:17,600
It doesn't mean I can always be scolded on your behalf. Don't worry.

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,600
What I regret most is that I was too honest before

10
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,520
From now on, you will put on that facial mask

11
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,320
Save it for someone willing to take the blame for you.

12
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:28,920
That's just right

13
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:32,570
I have no intention of coming back for another one.

14
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:33,730
I'm not here to be an idiot

15
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,970
I can make clothes, alter pants, sew things

16
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:37,970
I used to be a fashion designer

17
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:40,450
I can also pattern and cut

18
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:41,450
There are no machines on the island

19
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,450
My hand sewing is a little slower but I can do it

20
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:45,990
Make me something wearable in one day

21
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:48,990
A leather jacket that can withstand rain and won’t affect your movements for a day

22
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:51,500
If you can't do it, leave now and I'll do it.
